eference/server-api-reference/c_GlideRecordScopedAPI.md","line":108},{"title":"Customizing Configurable Workspace with declarative actions","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-user-interface/declarative-actions-landing.md","line":114},{"title":"update","target":"r_Update","line":117},{"title":"Create a UI routing action","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/scripts/useful-client-side-scripts.md","line":173},{"title":"Create knowledge articles from HR cases","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/servicenow-platform/ui-action-hrcase-article.md","line":174},{"title":"Task relationships with UI actions","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/r_UIActions.md","line":175},{"title":"GlideRecord","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/c_GlideRecordScopedAPI.md","line":179},{"title":"current","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/scripts/c_ScriptableServiceCatalogVariables.md","line":185},{"title":"insert","target":"r_Insert","line":192},{"title":"GlideRecord","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/c_GlideRecordScopedAPI.md","line":246},{"title":"current","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/scripts/c_ScriptableServiceCatalogVariables.md","line":252},{"title":"Scripted templates","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/r_ScriptedTemplates.md","line":252},{"title":"Task relationships with UI actions","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/r_UIActions.md","line":252},{"title":"insert","target":"r_Insert","line":295},{"title":"update","target":"r_Update","line":296}],"metadata":{"title":"action - Scoped, Global","description":"The action API provides methods to handle data for URLs in a UI action script.Gets a GlideURI object to determine the user view.Gets the URL of the return page in view after a UI action is complete.Gets the value of a URL parameter.Opens a page with a GlideRecord in the user view.Indicates whether to enable or disable pop-up windows on the page in the current view.Sets the redirect URI for this transaction, which determines the next page the user sees.Sets the return URI for this transaction after a UI action is complete. You can use this method to determine what page the user has in view when they return from submit.Sets a URL parameter name and value.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/api-reference/server-api-reference/ActionAPIBoth.html","release":"australia","product":"Server API Reference","classification":"server-api-reference","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":4,"breadcrumb":["Server API reference","API reference","API implementation and reference"],"tags":["#api-reference","#glidesystem","#gliderecord","#server-side","#glide","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[62,68],[82,84],[98,100],[116,124],[162,165],[187,206],[210,238],[254,274],[289,291]],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/api-reference/server-api-reference/ActionAPIBoth.md"},
